 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
 *   **Precision:** Homogeneous calculations can suffer from precision issues near the clipping planes [G].
-*   **Winding Order:** The sign of the plane dot product depends on the winding order of the triangle. Inconsistent winding will cause incorrect culling [G].
